      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The final plan had a clear document bag, gynecology follow-up, colonoscopy-prep deferral, and fallback to gastroenterology/endoscopy. It was not safe closure because the red-flag safety net remained incomplete for this postoperative episode and medication reconciliation was not fully transferred.",
